      "text": "APIs:\n\nuser info retrieved from session token or JWT\n\n\nPOST /comments/:liveVideoId\n{\n  message\n}\n\n\nGET /comments/:liveVideoId?cursor={last_comment_id}&pageSize={}&sort=desc\n->\nComment{\n    id,\n    content,\n    author,\n    createdAt\n}[]\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "APIs:\n\nuser info retrieved from session token or JWT\n\n\nPOST /comments/:liveVideoId\n{\n  message\n}\n\n\nGET /comments/:liveVideoId?cursor={last_comment_id}&pageSize={}&sort=desc\n->\nComment{\n    id,\n    content,\n    author,\n    createdAt\n}[]\n",
