      "updated": 1775940863139,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why short Poll to fetch new comments won't work:\n\n→ Short polling requires increasing frequency as system scales 📈\n→ Most requests return no new data - wasteful, unnecessary DB load\n→ \"Near real-time\" would demand polling every few milliseconds — not feasible ❌\n\nTradeoff:\nLower poll frequency = less DB strain but worse latency;\nhigher frequency = better real-time feel but unsustainable resource cost at scale ⚖️",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "DLOo7atFoFszTGojkkkTR",
      "originalText": "Why short Poll to fetch new comments won't work:\n\n→ Short polling requires increasing frequency as system scales 📈\n→ Most requests return no new data - wasteful, unnecessary DB load\n→ \"Near real-time\" would demand polling every few milliseconds — not feasible ❌\n\nTradeoff:\nLower poll frequency = less DB strain but worse latency;\nhigher frequency = better real-time feel but unsustainable resource cost at scale ⚖️",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4nZjJ86ACOS76NNCd_FYI",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 3807.7839714355327,
      "y": 545.7474731215191,
      "width": 819.2148287573746,
      "height": 1174.2852587486798,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
